{"parse": {"title": "Barronite deposit", "pageid": 308592, "revid": 15190174, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Infobox Item\n|name = Barronite deposit\n|image = [[File:Barronite deposit.png]]\n|release = [[14 April]] [[2021]]\n|update = Below Ice Mountain\n|members = No\n|quest = No\n|tradeable = No\n|equipable = No\n|stackable = No\n|noteable = No\n|options = Drop\n|examine = A deposit of strange glowing ore that looks quite smashable. I wonder what's inside?\n|value = 1\n|weight = 0.200\n|id = 25684\n}}\n[[File:Barronite deposit detail.png|left|104x104px]]\n\n'''Barronite deposits''' are found whilst mining [[barronite rocks]] within the [[Ruins of Camdozaal]]. Each deposit mined yields 32 [[Mining]] [[experience]]. Mining barronite does not consume [[celestial ring]] charges, but the +4 invisible Mining [[boost]] still applies.\n\nUsing them on the [[Barronite Crusher]] anvil, near [[Ramarno]], with a [[hammer]] yields 30 [[Smithing]] experience and various rewards, including [[barronite shards]].\n\n==Skill info==\n===Mining===\n{{Mining info\n|name = Barronite deposit\n|level = 14\n|xp = 32\n|rock = [[Rocks (Barronite)]]\n|tool = [[Pickaxe]]\n|time = 1 minute\n}}\n===Smithing===\n{{Skill info\n|skill1name = Smithing\n|skill1lvl = 14\n|skill1exp = 30\n|tool = [[Hammer]]\n|facility = [[Barronite Crusher]]\n}}\n\n==Drops==\n{{DropLogProject|kills=498229|type=deposits}}\n\n'''Notes''':\n*Activating the [[Charm of Luck]] at [[Ramarno]] slightly increases the chance of obtaining rare items.\n*The ancient relics do not drop in order. You may receive multiple of each.\n*Items are rolled for when the deposit is opened, so one may stockpile them in free-to-play and still receive an Imcando hammer when opening them in members.\n{{DropsTableHead|leagueRegion=Asgarnia}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Barronite shards|quantity=6-8|rarity=12/13|Approx=Yes|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Barronite shards|quantity=15-35|rarity=1/20|Approx=Yes|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Barronite head|quantity=1|rarity=1/200|Approx=Yes|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Imcando hammer (broken)|namenotes={{(m)}}|quantity=1|rarity=1/300|raritynotes={{refn|group=d|There is a 1/15 chance to receive a broken Imcando hammer if no barronite shards are rolled.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1442217804883578885|date=26 September 2021|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/102282|archivedate=25 February 2023|quote=1/15 if you aren't getting barronite shards.}} The chance not to receive shards can be influenced by [[Charm (Ruins of Camdozaal)|charms]]; if none are active, the effective rate of the hammer is around 1/300.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1494306161599959045|date=17 February 2022|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/98853|archivedate=13 February 2023|quote=I think it'd be about 1/300.}}}}|Approx=Yes|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Ancient astroscope|quantity=1|rarity=1/350|Approx=Yes|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Ancient carcanet|quantity=1|rarity=1/350|Approx=Yes|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Ancient globe|quantity=1|rarity=1/350|Approx=Yes|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Ancient ledger|quantity=1|rarity=1/350|Approx=Yes|skill=smithing}} \n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Ancient treatise|quantity=1|rarity=1/350|Approx=Yes|skill=smithing}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Item sources==\n{{Drop sources|Barronite deposit}}\n\n==Products==\n{{Uses material list|Barronite deposit}}\n\n==Changes==\n{{Subject changes header}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 5 May 2021\n|update = Games Room Tables and Fishing Skill Boss Improvements\n|change = Smithing experience gained from crushing a Barronite deposit increased from 10.2 to 30.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 16 April 2021\n|type = Hotfix\n|update = Below Ice Mountain\n|change =\n* Mining experience gained from obtaining a Barronite deposit increased from 24 to 32.\n* The chance of successfully mining Barronite at high Mining levels has been decreased, but the chance at low Mining levels has been increased.\n* The extra chance of success afforded by the Charm of Mining has been increased from 5% to 10%.\n}}\n{{Subject changes\n|date = 15 April 2021\n|type = Hotfix\n|update = Below Ice Mountain\n|change =\n* The base chance of getting a Barronite deposit increased from 3% to 24%.\n* Mining experience gained from obtaining a Barronite deposit reduced to 24 from 250.\n* Smithing experience gained from crushing a Barronite deposit reduced to 10.2 from 37.5.\n* Unique items from Barronite are now 8x rarer to receive, with the Broken hammer being 3x rarer.\n* The Charm of Mining now gives an extra 5% chance of success when mining, rather than 5% additional deposits.\n}}\n{{Subject changes footer}}\n\n==References==\n{{Reflist}}\n\n{{Ruins of Camdozaal}}\n{{Mining}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:21:34.479176+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Barronite_shards\" title=\"Barronite shards\"><img alt=\"Barronite shards.png: Barronite deposit drops Barronite shards with rarity 12/13 in quantity 6-8\" src=\"/images/Barronite_shards_25.png?9b48a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"29\" height=\"29\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"29\" data-file-height=\"29\" /></a></span></td><td class=\"item-col\" style=\"text-align: